//  then manually reviewed instruction-by-instruction (T5).  Review:
//  test/sm120_mve/T5_REVIEW.md; golden regression: test/sm120_l2_gen/.
//
//    guardian (50 instrs, BSYNC-reconverged at +0x310):
//      LDC R4/R5 @ c[0x0][0x170/0x174]  preempt buffer pointer
//      LDC R6/R7 @ c[0x0][0x180/0x184]  kernel idx
//      (debugger-parameters window c[0x0][0x170..0x188], T1-verified)
//    resume   (32 instrs, keeps the RET.ABS.NODEC R20 exit):
//      LDC R4/R5 @ c[0x0][0x170/0x174]  preempt buffer pointer
//      LDC R20/R21 @ c[0x0][0x178/0x17c]  jump-back entry point
//
//  Resource requirements (T3 review): RequiredRegs = 32, RequiredBarriers = 1.
//
//  Regenerate:
//    cd platforms/cuda/hal/inject && make_msvc.bat ARCH=120 bin dump cc
//    python tools/instrument/extract_sass.py generate --cubin inject_120.cubin
//        --source inject.cu --offset-map sm120 --out-cubin <verify>.cubin
// =====================================================================

